  - pause_dag: Pause promotion of WAITING children in the DAG rooted at `root_job_id`. Observable effect: `get_dag_state(root_job_id)` returns `paused=true` with `paused_expires_in_seconds`, children stay in status `waiting`, and no new promotions occur while the flag is set. Already-RUNNING jobs are not cancelled — pause stops promotion, it does not stop work in flight. Self-cleans on TTL (default 10 minutes), after which held children promote automatically. Idempotent.
